  "id": "half_cell",
  "name": {
    "en": "Half-cell / half-cut cell layout",
    "es": "Celula partida (half-cell)"
  },
  "kind": "technology",
  "description": {
    "en": "Cell format, not a cell chemistry: cells cut in half lengthwise to halve the current per string and reduce resistive loss and hot spots. Applies to PERC, TOPCon, HJT and bifacial cells. Reference: REC Alpha Pure-R (80 half-cut cells); Qcells XL (156 half cells) and JinkoSolar (132 = 66x2) are cited in the md file.",
    "es": "Formato de celda, no una quimica: celdas cortadas a lo largo por la mitad para reducir la corriente por cadena y las perdidas resistivas y los puntos calientes. Aplica a celdas PERC, TOPCon, HJT y bifaciales. Referencia: REC Alpha Pure-R (80 celdas partidas); Qcells XL (156 medias celdas) y JinkoSolar (132 = 66x2) citados en el archivo md."
  },
  "typical_use": "Standard layout for most utility and commercial modules.",
